    "identifier": "CursExit",
    "type": "text",
    "context": "#. GT: Cursive Exit. This defines a point on the glyph that should be matched\n#. GT: with the \"Cursive Entry\" point of the following glyph. This allows\n#. GT: scripts such as Urdu to work\n#: ../fontforgeexe/cvgetinfo.cpp:1470\n",
